    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flappy Lord \u2013 Keep the 200 Kilos in the air!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face an absurd challenge: Control &quot;the Lord,&quot; an exceptionally heavy bird with big ambitions but minimal aerodynamics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn, hard to master \u2013 timing and precision will decide whether you succeed or fail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746030/extras/273bc2346db010bf02adaedcea6a93cb.poster.avif?t=1754351192\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746030/extras/273bc2346db010bf02adaedcea6a93cb.webm?t=1754351192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746030/extras/273bc2346db010bf02adaedcea6a93cb.mp4?t=1754351192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Leaderboards &amp; Highscore Hunting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against players from all over the world and prove your skills. Will you become a Meddler or a Jester?</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay accompanied by the finest Meddl</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your flight attempts are accompanied by the best variations of the &quot;L\u00fcgenlord&quot; song.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Integration, Achievements &amp; In-Game Shop</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect achievements, climb the ranks on the leaderboards, and unlock additional content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746030/extras/2300450fdf80993c625a02f6175950a3.poster.avif?t=1754351192\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746030/extras/2300450fdf80993c625a02f6175950a3.webm?t=1754351192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746030/extras/2300450fdf80993c625a02f6175950a3.mp4?t=1754351192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ready to Meddl?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get <strong>Flappy Lord</strong> now and see how long you can keep Rainerle airborne!</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746030/extras/9f96d85290dea44596b214a79c8fea55.avif?t=1754351192\" width=1024 height=1024 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flappy Lord \u2013 Keep the 200 Kilos in the air!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face an absurd challenge: Control &quot;the Lord,&quot; an exceptionally heavy bird with big ambitions but minimal aerodynamics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn, hard to master \u2013 timing and precision will decide whether you succeed or fail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746030/extras/273bc2346db010bf02adaedcea6a93cb.poster.avif?t=1754351192\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746030/extras/273bc2346db010bf02adaedcea6a93cb.webm?t=1754351192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746030/extras/273bc2346db010bf02adaedcea6a93cb.mp4?t=1754351192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Leaderboards &amp; Highscore Hunting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against players from all over the world and prove your skills. Will you become a Meddler or a Jester?</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay accompanied by the finest Meddl</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your flight attempts are accompanied by the best variations of the &quot;L\u00fcgenlord&quot; song.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Integration, Achievements &amp; In-Game Shop</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect achievements, climb the ranks on the leaderboards, and unlock additional content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746030/extras/2300450fdf80993c625a02f6175950a3.poster.avif?t=1754351192\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746030/extras/2300450fdf80993c625a02f6175950a3.webm?t=1754351192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746030/extras/2300450fdf80993c625a02f6175950a3.mp4?t=1754351192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ready to Meddl?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get <strong>Flappy Lord</strong> now and see how long you can keep Rainerle airborne!</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746030/extras/9f96d85290dea44596b214a79c8fea55.avif?t=1754351192\" width=1024 height=1024 /></span></p>",
